<title>GREECE: GREEK BOURSE CORRECTS 2.11 PERCENT BEFORE CLOSE.</title>
<headline>GREEK BOURSE CORRECTS 2.11 PERCENT BEFORE CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens share index fell 2.11 percent at 1,085.63 points ten minutes before the end of the session on Wednesday, in what market watchers said was a correction after last week's steep rise. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
